WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,450
Add Mr. Zhang on WeChat

2
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:03,170
Do you think I meet the standards of your front desk?

3
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:04,290
I promise to be obedient

4
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:06,690
Mr. Zhang, please cooperate. Damn it.

5
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:09,610
If Caiyoumen has to come up with something big, he can't ignore it.

6
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:11,810
You really pushed me into the fire pit.

7
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:12,930
Dear students

8
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:14,330
Everyone, calm down

9
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,730
Mr. Zhang is just here to check on the company’s affairs today.

10
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:19,890
Recruitment officially starts on the 26th. Everyone is gathered here.

11
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,330
Not only does it affect school order

12
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:23,730
It will also delay Mr. Zhang’s formal appointment.

13
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:25,370
What about the benefits in the job advertisement?

14
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:26,410
is it really true

15
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:27,610
The car is here

16
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:29,530
There is no need to question Mr. Zhang’s strength.

17
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:30,930
Want a high-paying position

18
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,850
Everyone will go to the Economic and Trade Building for an interview on the 26th.

19
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:34,770
Now all spread out

20
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,650
Make way for Mr. Zhang too

21
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:38,090
Don’t leave a phantom influence on the big boss

22
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:40,860
Get out of the way now

23
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,020
See you on the 26th

24
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:44,220
Mr. Zhang walked slowly away to Luo Pang

25
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,460
You are very patient

26
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:46,780
Recruiting people with a monthly salary of 50,000

27
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,860
And put the Ferrari in my name

28
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,460
Write in the advertisement and stamp it

29
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:52,500
When did recruitment become showing off, Boss Tong?

30
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,660
I am also doing this for the sake of the company’s appearance.
